msgstr "Masuk lain kali"

#: src/window.rs:2011
msgid ""
"The SSH agent makes selected keys available to SSH applications during this "
"session."
msgstr ""
"Agen SSH menyediakan kunci yang dipilih bagi aplikasi SSH selama sesi ini."

#: src/window.rs:630
msgid "Yubico Authenticator is installed"
msgstr "Yubico Authenticator telah diinstal"

#: src/window.rs:687
msgid "Yubico Authenticator is not installed"
msgstr "Yubico Authenticator belum diinstal"

#: src/window.rs:920
msgid ""
"Yubico Authenticator lets you view and manage passkeys stored on your "
"YubiKey. This security center does not read, create, or delete passkeys; it "
"only opens the installed app."
msgstr ""
"Yubico Authenticator memungkinkan Anda melihat dan mengelola kunci sandi "
"yang tersimpan di YubiKey. Pusat keamanan ini tidak membaca, membuat, atau "
"menghapus kunci sandi; pusat ini hanya membuka aplikasi yang telah diinstal."

